      "content": "hungry baby spots?? i've never heard of that before. is that serious? he seems okay otherwise just a bit sleepy. i really dont want to take him to the ER at this hour if it's just something minor. can you tell me more about what those spots are and if i can just give him some tylenol and watch him til tmrw?",
